# Sanctuary 0b_cliff_hall_dark layer 4: CIngBlobSwarm e1033002b, e1033007c (5 attackers, attack
# proximity 20, attack angle 50). For tools/cov/specs/swarmbasics.py: the god-mode player stands at
# the swarms so boids turn, play the into-attack model, launch and hit the player or a surface, then
# moves above and below them (LaunchBoid's drop sign), shoots attackers, and deletes one swarm.
